23	// The tests of Seed (DEVDESK-505, NX-02a, step 7; Plane DEVDESK-542):
24	//
25	//	Seed(ctx, SeedDeps{Runner, Forwarder, Copier, Clock, Store}, baseURL, p, out) (SeedResult, error)
26	//
27	// against a provisioned fake Nexus (fakenexus_test.go), the scripted kubectl of
28	// upstream_test.go, a recording port-forward, a recording image copier that models
29	// the three registries (upstream, docker-hosted, docker-proxy) and the fake clock.
30	//
31	// What the tests assume, to settle with the code (the choices are the tester's):
32	//   - Order: credentials from the store (admin, then bench-pull; nothing else is
33	//     touched when one is missing) -> the state of the upstream (ReadUpstream, read
34	//     only) -> OCI layout in a temporary folder -> port-forward to
35	//     svc/bench-upstream:5000 -> the upstream images, in the order of Dataset() ->
36	//     the port-forward is stopped -> the docker-hosted images, in the order of
37	//     Dataset() -> the PullThrough images through docker-proxy -> the two listings.
38	//   - An image is copied only when the manifest digest read at its destination
39	//     (ImageCopier.ManifestDigest) differs from the one of the data set. A
40	//     ManifestDigest error of kind SeedFailed ("manifest unknown") means "absent";
41	//     any other error stops the seed. Every Copy carries PreserveDigests.
42	//   - Credentials: no credentials for the upstream (no authentication), the stored
43	//     admin for docker-hosted, the stored bench-pull for docker-proxy. The proxy is
44	//     only ever read for a PullThrough image (F9): a read of mirror/uncached through
45	//     it would cache it. The group is never touched.
46	//   - A PullThrough image already listed by docker-proxy with the right digest is
47	//     not pulled again (the second run copies nothing). How Seed knows (a REST
48	//     listing, or a read through the proxy) is left to the code.
49	//   - NX-02a: a cut upstream is an error (kind SeedFailed, "the upstream is cut")
50	//     without any write: restoring it is NX-02b. An upstream that is missing or still
51	//     starting is a SeedFailed too, and an upstream URL that is not the bench's is
52	//     refused (it names NEXUS_BENCH_UPSTREAM_URL): the bench would push to a registry
53	//     the proxy does not read. Seed never scales, never applies, never writes to
54	//     Nexus.
55	//   - The final listings are read by REST with the admin account, after every copy.
56	//     docker-proxy must list exactly the PullThrough images, docker-hosted exactly
57	//     the hosted ones (name and tag; a digest the instance lists must be the one of
58	//     the data set). A missing component is waited for, by Clock, 30 s at most (the
59	//     same bound for both repositories, H-COMPONENTS), then it is a SeedFailed. A
60	//     component outside the data set is a SeedFailed at once, without waiting, that
61	//     names the repository and says to run `mise run nexus-bench:reset`.
62	//   - Every failure is a *BenchError; the error of the copier, of the forwarder or
63	//     of the REST client stays reachable with errors.Is/As and is never printed.
64	//     A cancelled context is returned so that errors.Is(err, context.Canceled) holds.
65	//   - The port-forward is opened once per Seed, stopped on every path, and its
66	//     address must be a loopback literal or Seed refuses it before any copy.
67	//   - The temporary folders (layout, pull-through target) are under TMPDIR and gone
68	//     when Seed returns. Output: lines that start with "seed: ", no password. A nil
69	//     writer is accepted.
70	//   - SeedResult.Images is Dataset(): every digest filled, PullThrough true exactly
71	//     for the images cached in docker-proxy (DatasetImage has no CachedInProxy field).
72	
73	const (
74		// seedForwardLocal is the loopback address the fake port-forward hands out.
75		seedForwardLocal = "127.0.0.1:41234"
76		// seedWaitBound is the longest wait for a listing (H-COMPONENTS).
77		seedWaitBound = 30 * time.Second
78	
79		whereUpstream = "upstream"
80		whereHosted   = "hosted"
81		whereProxy    = "proxy"
82	)
